// grabient kY4mpDazO-mUuu_fuLqXU49dvVP6
// https://grabient.com/kY4mpDazO-mUuu_fuLqXU49dvVP6?style=rosette
// the rosette, the palette in rings of petals on a golden spiral, as GLSL ES 3.00, the WebGL page's shaders
//
// Each frame is one pass over the canvas: each pixel taken back through the loop's zoom and turn into the petals'
